  m_Name: Yuuchi_NoYuuchi
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CutsceneData
  sequence:
  - background: {fileID: 0}
    clearBackground: 0
    speakerName: Ryuuji
    dialogue:
    - (Looks like Yuuchi's gone out. He's usually with Noto-san's kid at this time.)
    - '(I still remember Maya-san''s excitement when she heard Taiga was pregnant
      at the same time she was.) '
    - ("Maybe our kids could be friends!", she said. From early on in their pregnancies,
      until the boys started elementary school, they hung out together much more
      than I'd ever seen since high school.)
    - (I don't think Taiga even liked her that much. She was always complaining to
      me behind Maya-san's back about things she said or did.)
    - (And yet, she wouldn't stop hanging out with her. Was she just doing that for
      Yuuchi's sake? It looks like she made the right call. Yuuchi and Hisanosuke-kun
      look like good friends.)
    - (If only we'd done the same for our daughters...)
  alternateSequences: []
